## Key Concepts

- Multi-tenant isolation and quota enforcement
- GPU memory pressure handling and dynamic batch sizing
- Backpressure and queueing behavior under burst loads
- Rollback and feature-flag safety mechanisms during rollouts

## Code Example

```javascript
